e - Taipei.\n\nCÉ LA VI Taipei, 48F Nan Shan Plaza, Xinyi\n\nBottom line: CÉ LA VI Taipei at 48F Nan Shan Plaza is the venue, with ~85–90% confidence. https://t.co/W2quWLAEYu", "url": "https://x.com/GG34607662/status/2116637527226409216"}, {"author_id": "1289519905734135808", "created_at": "2026-10-31T21:34:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116644923009106153"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/techfund1/stat…", "end": 200, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/techfund1/status/2116501035212558681", "start": 177, "url": "https://t.co/cNUdELHi5P"}]}, "id": "2116644923009106153", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116501035212558681", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Roughly 3.5x current DRAM estimates. I've read more realistic requirements in sci-fi novels. Either HBM economics get solved fast or that 'aspirational' TAM stays aspirational. https://t.co/cNUdELHi5P", "url": "https://x.com/nelsonnets/status/2116644923009106153"}, {"author_id": "747120849585483776", "created_at": "2026-10-31T21:12:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116639438025682992"], "id": "2116639438025682992", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 70, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "布団に入ってきて腕枕でご機嫌に寝ている猫を起こしたくなくてかれこれ30分ばかり。HBM間に合うかな？", "url": "https://x.com/yaniel_farm/status/2116639438025682992"}, {"author_id": "1181843216850542593", "created_at": "2026-10-31T21:50:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116649036958883902"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 76, "start": 68, "tag": "キボシイシガメ"}, {"end": 82, "start": 78, "tag": "てつ亀"}, {"end": 93, "start": 84, "tag": "セレクトブリード"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/nzo6AgszAn", "end": 117, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/T3_kamekame/status/2116649036958883902/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116649031338467328", "start": 94, "url": "https:/